      "text": "APIs:\nuid retrieved from session cookies\n\n\nPOST /v1/urls/\n{\n    originalUrl,\n    customAlias?,\n    expiryDate?\n}\n->\n{\n    shortUrl\n}\n\n\nGET /<shortCode>\n-> 302 redirect to originalUrl\n",
