      "text": "Choosing the right HTTP method (verb) to use.\n\n→ POST (Create) → ➕\n→ GET (Read) → 🔍\n→ PUT (Update) → ✏️\n→ DELETE (Delete) → 🗑️",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "9RSXpO6QURspWxwhz4YKQ",
      "originalText": "Choosing the right HTTP method (verb) to use.\n\n→ POST (Create) → ➕\n→ GET (Read) → 🔍\n→ PUT (Update) → ✏️\n→ DELETE (Delete) → 🗑️",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
