      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔀 2 types of HTTP redirects:\n\n→ 📌 301 (Permanent Redirect)\n        → 🏠 Resource permanently moved to target URL.\n        → 💾 Browsers cache this response.\n        → ⚡ Subsequent requests go directly to long URL, bypassing our server.\n\nHTTP/1.1 301 Moved Permanently\nLocation: https://www.original-long-url.com\n\n→ 🔄 302 (Found)\n        → 📍 Resource temporarily located at different URL.\n        → 🚫 Browsers do not cache this response.\n        → 🔁 Future requests always go through our server first.\n\nHTTP/1.1 302 Found\nLocation: https://www.original-long-url.com\n\n✅ 302 redirect is often preferred because:\n    → 🎮 More control over redirection, allowing to update or expire links when needed.\n    → 🛡️ Prevents browsers caching redirects, can cause consistency issues when we need\nto change or delete the short URL.\n    → 📊 Allows to track click statistics for each short URL (even though this is out of\nscope for this design).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jiekSUidM_ncPmK4qEXYn",
      "originalText": "🔀 2 types of HTTP redirects:\n\n→ 📌 301 (Permanent Redirect)\n        → 🏠 Resource permanently moved to target URL.\n        → 💾 Browsers cache this response.\n        → ⚡ Subsequent requests go directly to long URL, bypassing our server.\n\nHTTP/1.1 301 Moved Permanently\nLocation: https://www.original-long-url.com\n\n→ 🔄 302 (Found)\n        → 📍 Resource temporarily located at different URL.\n        → 🚫 Browsers do not cache this response.\n        → 🔁 Future requests always go through our server first.\n\nHTTP/1.1 302 Found\nLocation: https://www.original-long-url.com\n\n✅ 302 redirect is often preferred because:\n    → 🎮 More control over redirection, allowing to update or expire links when needed.\n    → 🛡️ Prevents browsers caching redirects, can cause consistency issues when we need\nto change or delete the short URL.\n    → 📊 Allows to track click statistics for each short URL (even though this is out of scope for this design).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
